  "description": "metrics.listen answers a request whose Host names its address: that address in any form the grammar of api.listen takes, with its port, or, for a loopback address, localhost in any case of its ASCII letters, 127.0.0.1 or [::1], with its port. A Host with no port names port 80. Nothing is resolved. Any other Host is misdirected, 421, so that a page a browser loaded from another name, which DNS rebinding then points at the address, reads nothing.",
